            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.16 — A little glow</h3>
<ul>
<li>The New Tab box glows with a soft rainbow edge while you type.</li>
<li>While Pane is answering, the page's edge glows and gently pulses, and the box you asked from lights up.</li>
<li>Small touches: the greeting sharpens in, site tiles pop in, sparkles pulse while Pane thinks, and tab icons lift when you hover them.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
